        },
        {
          "text": "Ubeka isandla sakhe esikhonkwaneni nesandla sakhe sokunene esandweni sabasebenzayo; wamshaya uSisera ngesando, wamgqabula ikhanda, ehlaba, eshaya izinhlafuno zakhe.",
